1
00:00:00,093 --> 00:00:03,263
(Raj:)But your ideas are stupid
and I want a Jet Ski.

2
00:00:03,430 --> 00:00:05,600
(Sheldon:)I found it. The ring is mine.

3
00:00:05,765 --> 00:00:09,265
(Sheldon:)I don't understand why in this group
I never get my way.

4
00:00:12,230 --> 00:00:14,940
(Leonard:)You always get your way.

5
00:00:15,609 --> 00:00:18,779
(Sheldon:)I'll stipulate to that
if you give me the ring.

6
00:00:19,779 --> 00:00:22,449
Hey. Enjoying your food
that I actually brought you...

7
00:00:22,616 --> 00:00:26,286
(Penny:)...instead of promising food
but bringing you a box of random crap?

8
00:00:26,661 --> 00:00:29,291
(Leonard:)Yeah, it's delicious.
The sarcasm's a little stale, though.

9
00:00:29,456 --> 00:00:30,536
[HOWARD LAUGHS]

10
00:00:30,999 --> 00:00:34,789
(Leonard:)How about this? Until we figure out
what to do with the ring, Penny holds it.

11
00:00:34,961 --> 00:00:37,461
(Penny:)-What ring?
-This ring.

12
00:00:38,381 --> 00:00:40,591
(Sheldon:)Looking for something?

13
00:00:42,594 --> 00:00:45,134
-Will you hold this for a couple of days?
-Why?

14
00:00:45,305 --> 00:00:48,185
(Leonard:)It's a prop from a movie
and we're kind of fighting over it.

15
00:00:48,391 --> 00:00:50,851
The first piece of jewelry
my boyfriend gives me...

16
00:00:51,019 --> 00:00:54,109
(Penny:)...is a prop from a movie
and I don't even get to keep it?

17
00:00:54,898 --> 00:00:56,778
If you had gone out with me years ago...

18
00:00:56,942 --> 00:00:59,022
...you'd have my Aunt Ida's brooch...

